1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,860
Every morning, she drew at the same café.

2
00:00:02,860 --> 00:00:06,030
And every morning, her bag took the other chair.

3
00:00:06,030 --> 00:00:08,801
Until someone asked, “Mind if I sit?”

4
00:00:08,801 --> 00:00:10,979
She hesitated... then moved it.

5
00:00:10,979 --> 00:00:12,551
He noticed her sketchbook.

6
00:00:12,551 --> 00:00:14,355
“Wait... you drew this?”

7
00:00:14,355 --> 00:00:16,636
They talked until their coffee went cold.

8
00:00:16,636 --> 00:00:19,201
The next morning, she saved his seat.

9
00:00:19,201 --> 00:00:20,335
Then the next.

10
00:00:20,335 --> 00:00:22,899
By the fourth morning, the bag was back.

11
00:00:22,899 --> 00:00:25,979
That's when she heard, “I tried drawing our table.”

12
00:00:25,979 --> 00:00:27,422
He held up a sketchbook.

13
00:00:27,422 --> 00:00:28,556
Crooked legs.

14
00:00:28,556 --> 00:00:29,922
Cups like potatoes.

15
00:00:29,972 --> 00:00:32,267
She laughed... and pulled out his chair.
